WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Balancer timing belt
What it does: Keeps the balance shaft drive synchronised with the crankshaft.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Balancer timing belt
How it works: The belt transmits motion through the system.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Balancer timing belt
How it moves: Travels around a closed loop; its teeth engage the pulleys.
